    "title": "Doorzo - Japan proxy services",
    "description": "Doorzo is an official partner of multiple shopping platforms in Japan, such as Mercari and Rakuten. We offer a one-stop solution for proxy purchasing and global shipping. No matter new and second-hand products. In Doorzo, you can fully enjoy the fun of shopping from Japan! \r\n\r\n\u3010Official partnerships with major platform, various products\u3011\r\nA real-time synchronized product data ranging from anime mechanism, figures, board games, trading cards, clothing and miscellaneous items. Not only do we have brand new items available but also great deals on high-quality used goods waiting for you to discover!\r\n\r\n\u3010Exclusive 60-day extended storage service\u3011\r\nYou don't need to worry about storage as we consolidate purchases from multiple websites before shipping them out internationally. We offer various shipping methods and global shipping options. \r\n\r\n\u3010 Instant translation helps overcome language barriers\u3011\r\nWith our 24-hour automated bidding system, you won't miss out on your desired treasures.\r\n\r\n\u3010More flexible payment options\u3011\r\nWe offer various credit cards and PayPal for secure transactions that make it easy to shop for your favorite items\r\n\r\n\u3010Professional customer service team \u3011\r\nWe have a professional team to support you no matter where you are located. Dedicated support staff is fluent in English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, and Japanese languages to promptly address any pre-sales or after-sales inquiries ensuring a worry-free shopping experience.",
